---
// ContactCTA Section
---

<section id="contact" style="padding: 5rem 2rem; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center;">
  <p style="color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Get In Touch</p>
  <h2 style="font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; color: var(--color-text); margin-bottom: 1rem;">Ready to Fly with Us?</h2>
  <p style="color: var(--color-muted); max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;">
    Contact our team and let us handle every detail of your next flight.
  </p>
  <a href="mailto:ops@flyger.com" id="cta-contact-btn" style="display: inline-block; padding: 0.875rem 2.5rem; background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-secondary-start), var(--color-secondary-end)); color: var(--color-text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; border-radius: 0.375rem; font-size: 1rem;">
    Contact Us
  </a>
</section>
